 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Fairy Spring"
  },
  "description": {
   "en": "Astil, daughter of Duke Zella, was born with cursed magic and shunned by all. To be rid of her, her father arranged a marriage to a lowborn baron’s son—yet love unexpectedly bloomed. But before happiness could take root, war shattered her homeland. Now, four years later, Astil lives far away in the free city of Halkavesi, separated from her past. Still, fate stirs again—and offers her one more chance at happiness."
  },
